<div class="nr">
	<div class="main_bd">
	         <div class="con_title">
   <h2 class="title">武韵风华——西电学子在陕西省第六届大学生武术（套路）锦标赛中获佳绩</h2>
   <p class="info">来源：<span class="xxly">
    </span>时间：<span class="time1">2026-01-01</span>点击数：<i class="djs"><script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1641759486, 6982)</script></i></p>
                 </div>



    <div id="vsb_content_2" class="content"><div class="v_news_content">
<p class="vsbcontent_start" style="font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">12月20日至21日，时隔六年，陕西省第六届大学生武术（套路）锦标赛在西安工商学院隆重举行。本次赛事由陕西省学生体育协会主办，共吸引来自全省36所高校的近400名武术健儿同台竞技、一展风采。我校武术队派出7名队员参赛，他们在赛场上凭借扎实的基本功和精湛的技法发挥出色，从激烈角逐中脱颖而出，最终斩获4枚金牌、7枚银牌、2枚铜牌的优异成绩。同时，我校代表队荣获本届赛事“体育道德风尚奖”。</span></p><p class="vsbcontent_img" style="font-size: 20px;"><img src="/__local/D/11/54/9970095CFCEF958EEC7EE165123_DDCD0437_17B06.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/D11549970095CFCEF958EEC7EE165123/DDCD0437/17B06" vheight=" 259.8pt" vwidth=" 346.5pt" orisrc="/__local/C/96/99/BE1ED74123B49B0F9A4A6D98017_7FB44C70_1651A.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="width: 346.5pt;height: 259.8pt"></p><p style="font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">在为期两天的紧凑赛程中，我校学子在领队孔东、青年教师沈奕霏的带领下，在赛场上以扎实的功底和锐意进取的精神，生动诠释了中华武术的当代风采。他们的一招一式行云流水，起落之间刚柔并济，将长期刻苦训练的汗水与积累，全然转化为赛场上的实力与底气。</span></p><p class="vsbcontent_end" style="font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 20px;">本次比赛，不仅彰显了西电学子顽强拼搏、追求卓越的体育精神，更是青春力量对传统文化的一次有力传承。今后，西安电子科技大学武术队将继续刻苦训练，精益求精，立志在未来的征程中不断超越，续写新的荣耀篇章。</span></p><p class="vsbcontent_img" style="font-size: 20px;"><img src="/__local/F/2C/59/1986AAF3C662015F5E21D69A304_D9F8BCF7_47F0F.jpeg" width="459" height="299" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/F2C591986AAF3C662015F5E21D69A304/D9F8BCF7/47F0F" vheight=" 299px" vwidth=" 459px" orisrc="/__local/9/64/AA/05332A0A600087C9B4DA26D3216_41069936_A46F7.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="width: 459px; height: 299px;"></p><span class="edui-editor-imagescale-hand0" style="padding: 0px; margin: -4px 0px 0px -4px; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, 宋体, serif; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); position: absolute; width: 6px; height: 6px; overflow: hidden; display: block; background-color: rgb(60, 157, 208); cursor: nw-resize; top: 0px; left: 0px; text-indent: 0px;"></span><span class="edui-editor-imagescale-hand1" style="padding: 0px; margin: -4px 0px 0px -4px; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, 宋体, serif; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); position: absolute; width: 6px; height: 6px; overflow: hidden; display: block; background-color: rgb(60, 157, 208); cursor: n-resize; top: 0px; left: 229.5px; text-indent: 0px;"></span><span class="edui-editor-imagescale-hand2" style="padding: 0px; margin: -4px 0px 0px -3px; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, 宋体, serif; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); position: absolute; width: 6px; height: 6px; overflow: hidden; display: block; background-color: rgb(60, 157, 208); cursor: ne-resize; top: 0px; left: 459px; text-indent: 0px;"></span><span class="edui-editor-imagescale-hand3" style="padding: 0px; margin: -4px 0px 0px -4px; font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, 宋体, serif; font-size: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); position: absolute; width: 6px; height: 6px; overflow: hidden; display: block; background-color: rgb(60, 157, 208); cursor: w-resize; top: 149.5px; left: 0px; text-indent: 0px;"></span><p class="vsbcontent_img" style="font-size: 20px;"><img src="/__local/4/2E/71/D0DD7022AAD7D995C207E74594D_307363CD_4D62A.jpg" vurl="/_vsl/42E71D0DD7022AAD7D995C207E74594D/307363CD/4D62A" width="470" height="273" vsbhref="vurl" vheight=" 273px" vwidth=" 470px" orisrc="/__local/F/9C/55/A3141208D390F1917110D5D5FA8_C06C6240_7C5C4.jpg" class="img_vsb_content" style="width: 470px; height: 273px;"></p><p class="vsbcontent_img" style="font-size: 20px;"><img src="/__local/9/A1/56/6D698AA93F1BFFD9208F4C24A15_4842D257_5F883.jpg" vurl="/_vsl/9A1566D698AA93F1BFFD9208F4C24A15/4842D257/5F883" width="400" height="265" border="0" vspace="0" hspace="0" title="" alt="" vsbhref="vurl" vheight=" 265px" vwidth=" 400px" orisrc="/__local/B/EE/6F/30C641511CD441E542AC2A40E79_5D3C11E0_7649B.jpg" class="img_vsb_content" style="width: 400px; height: 265px;"></p><p class="vsbcontent_img" style="font-size: 20px;"><img src="/__local/E/46/46/5B9009A7FAFDCFE02E5927FFD11_1116E50B_46D54.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/E46465B9009A7FAFDCFE02E5927FFD11/1116E50B/46D54" vheight=" 263.7pt" vwidth=" 406.35pt" orisrc="/__local/3/03/17/91BDE5B3D8D7C0DD2DC84907120_DC2E4363_401172.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="width: 406.35pt;height: 263.7pt"></p>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
    
